Package: luna2-client
Version: 2.0
Maintainer: ClusterVision
Architecture: amd64
Depends: initramfs-tools | dracut, shim-signed, grub-efi-amd64-signed, grub-efi-amd64-bin, mdadm, lvm2, gdisk, fdisk, lsscsi, jq, parted, dosfstools, lbzip2, aria2, efibootmgr, grepcidr, curl, openssh-server, dropbear-bin, tpm2-tools
Description: Luna node install module with lpart advanced-partitioner support
 Ships both an initramfs-tools hook and a dracut 95luna module. Ubuntu 22.04 and
 24.04 default to initramfs-tools; 25.10 and later default to dracut. The daemon
 packs with whichever the image provides, so one package covers both.
